---

This software shells out to, but does not bundle or link against, ffmpeg
(GPL/LGPL, https://ffmpeg.org) and optionally exiftool (Artistic/GPL,
https://exiftool.org). Install them separately via Homebrew; their licenses
are unaffected by and do not extend to this project's own MIT-licensed code.

Fisheye stitching geometry and approach adapted from Trek View's public blog
series and fusion2sphere's parameter files:
https://www.trekview.org/blog/gopro-fusion-fisheye-stitching-part-1/
https://github.com/trek-view/fusion2sphere
